From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcp: Implement the <random> multiprecision helpers and _Rng_abort.

<random>'s helpers were spec stubs: _MP_Mul, _MP_Add, _MP_Rem and _MP_Get,
the multiprecision arithmetic linear_congruential uses for a 64-bit
modulus ((a*b + c) mod m kept in the caller's five-cell array), and
_Rng_abort (an invalid engine or distribution parameter: the message on
stderr, then abort), in tr1 for msvcp90 and msvcp100 and in std for
msvcp110 and later; msvcp120_app and msvcp_win forward.
---
